38969>>>Object oDashboard is a cWebView
38971>>>
38971>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -  
38971>>>    // Add a DDO Structure 
38971>>>    //
38971>>>    // There is no need to synchronize a DD structure on the client so we do
38971>>>    // not set the Server property or send ADDOStructure. We will simply use
38971>>>    // DDO's to mine data and generate HTML for our cWebHTMLBox objects.
38971>>>    // It is the HTML in these objects that is sent to the client each time 
38971>>>    // this page is shown.
38971>>>    //
38971>>>    // Also, it is important for the drill-down Navigation interface that we
38971>>>    // do not set the Server property to some DDO because this will affect 
38971>>>    // constraints in the next view that we navigate to.
38971>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - 
38971>>>
